{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53214","headline":"诗偈 三十九 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 三十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"如来一真智，徧满娑婆界。\n殷勤说方便，有人自不解。\n无处不生心，有处多贪爱。\n心王作黑业，教他口忏悔。\n口忏心不改，心口相违背。\n不服无心药，病根总不差。\n着相求菩提，不免还他债。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}